  "verseCount": 32,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "32",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 32"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "32",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jacob Prepares to Meet Esau",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jacob also went on his way, and the angels of God met him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Jacob saw them, he said, \"This is the camp of God!\" So he named that place Mahanaim.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jacob sent messengers ahead of him to his brother Esau in the land of Seir, the country of Edom.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He instructed them: \"This is what you are to say to my lord Esau: 'Your servant Jacob says, I have been staying with Laban and have remained there till now.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I have cattle and donkeys, sheep and goats, male and female servants. Now I am sending this message to my lord, that I may find favor in your eyes.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When the messengers returned to Jacob, they said, \"We went to your brother Esau, and now he is coming to meet you, and four hundred men are with him.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In great fear and distress Jacob divided the people who were with him into two groups,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "and the flocks and herds and camels as well.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He thought, \"If Esau comes and attacks one group,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "the group",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "that is left may escape.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Jacob prayed, \"O God of my father Abraham, God of my father Isaac,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.32.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.32.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", you who said to me, 'Go back to your country and your relatives, and I will make you prosper,'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I am unworthy of all the kindness and faithfulness you have shown your servant. I had only my staff when I crossed this Jordan, but now I have become two camps.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Save me, I pray, from the hand of my brother Esau, for I am afraid he will come and attack me, and also the mothers with their children.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But you have said, 'I will surely make you prosper and will make your descendants like the sand of the sea, which cannot be counted.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He spent the night there, and from what he had with him he selected a gift for his brother Esau:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "two hundred female goats and twenty male goats, two hundred ewes and twenty rams,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thirty female camels with their young, forty cows and ten bulls, and twenty female donkeys and ten male donkeys.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He put them in the care of his servants, each herd by itself, and said to his servants, \"Go ahead of me, and keep some space between the herds.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He instructed the one in the lead: \"When my brother Esau meets you and asks, 'Who do you belong to, and where are you going, and who owns all these animals in front of you?'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "then you are to say, 'They belong to your servant Jacob. They are a gift sent to my lord Esau, and he is coming behind us.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He also instructed the second, the third and all the others who followed the herds: \"You are to say the same thing to Esau when you meet him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And be sure to say, 'Your servant Jacob is coming behind us.' \" For he thought, \"I will pacify him with these gifts I am sending on ahead; later, when I see him, perhaps he will receive me.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Jacob's gifts went on ahead of him, but he himself spent the night in the camp.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jacob Wrestles With God",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "That night Jacob got up and took his two wives, his two female servants and his eleven sons and crossed the ford of the Jabbok.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After he had sent them across the stream, he sent over all his possessions.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Jacob was left alone, and a man wrestled with him till daybreak.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When the man saw that he could not overpower him, he touched the socket of Jacob's hip so that his hip was wrenched as he wrestled with the man.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the man said, \"Let me go, for it is daybreak.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "GEN 32:26"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "But Jacob replied, \"I will not let you go unless you bless me.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The man asked him, \"What is your name?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "GEN 32:27"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Jacob,\" he answered.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the man said, \"Your name will no longer be Jacob, but Israel,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "because you have struggled with God and with humans and have overcome.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jacob said, \"Please tell me your name.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "GEN 32:29"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "But he replied, \"Why do you ask my name?\" Then he blessed him there.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Jacob called the place Peniel,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "saying, \"It is because I saw God face to face, and yet my life was spared.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
